  "description": "Build .NET applications that use multiple AI providers through consistent completion, streaming and tool workflows. Supports OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, DeepSeek and Perplexity with immutable request configuration, controllable runs, structured output, cancellable local tools, reasoning, search and citations. Optional image generation/editing uses typed options; local capability inspection helps applications choose model controls. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 4.0.0 and targets .NET Standard 2.1.",
