  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.0.0 is a coordinated major release with Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 4.0.0. Adds typed image quality/background/format and Pixels/Preset sizing, immutable CreateRequest builders, asynchronous tool object returns and cancellation, ordinary completion cancellation, AIRunResult snapshots, and local model-capability inspection. Update image option callers, read (await run.Result).Text, and rebuild completion consumers/custom implementations. GetCompletionAsync remains a string API. Adds Fable/Mythos 5.1, Gemini 3.7/3.8 Flash, Grok 4.6, DeepSeek Flash, Grok Imagine Image 2.0 and GPT Image 2.5 selections; Perplexity moves to Agent/Search/background APIs with an explicit Sonar migration. Reliability fixes cover request snapshots, tool cleanup, token totals/overflow, stream terminal validation, image payloads and structured retry limits. Cancellation stops cooperative client work without guaranteeing remote inference/billing cancellation. Migration: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/docs/v8-migration.md Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/core/Mythosia.AI/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v800",
